&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$3,500 annual &quot;Be Your Best Self&quot; boost.&lt;/strong&gt; Spend it on anything that helps you grow. Gym memberships, therapy, books, courses, massages, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
